    "board.cell.hintPair": {
      "comment": "Joins the two halves of a square's VoiceOver hint — the box it sits in (\"Box 2\") and how to place a digit — into one utterance. Punctuation and order only, no words of its own: a full stop and a space in English, \"。\" and no space in Japanese.",
