    "board.rose.eraseDigit": {
      "comment": "VoiceOver label of one petal of the digit ring — the petal whose digit is already placed in this square, or already pencilled in when the ring is writing pencil marks. %1$lld is the digit 1-9. A verb in the imperative, so it reads as a set with board.action.place and board.action.note, which label the other petals: activating this one clears the digit instead of writing it again. It says only that the digit is already there, never that it is wrong — do not translate it as a warning or an error.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
