    "channel.thermo.blurb": {
      "comment": "One-line subtitle under the Thermo channel's title. \"Tubes\" are the thermometer shapes; \"only rise\" means the digits along one must strictly increase. Convey \"the numbers along each shape always go up\". Under about 25 characters.",
