    "debrief.corrections": {
      "comment": "One of the counts on the debrief card: erasures and undos. Deliberately neutral — a solve with many corrections is a longer look, not a worse solve, so avoid any word implying error or mistake. PLURAL: %1$lld is the count, 0 or more.",
