    "debrief.duel.last": {
      "comment": "Debrief line after a two-player local game (PRD-27). %1$@ is a player's name (the name of their digit colour). A statement of fact about who completed the puzzle, NOT a declaration that they won — nothing in this app declares a winner. Full sentence, ends with a full stop.",
