    "debrief.longest": {
      "comment": "Debrief line naming the cell the player kept coming back to before finally filling it. %1$@ is already-translated text like \"Row 3, column 5\" (board.cell.label). \"Circled\" is figurative — the player circled around it, returning again and again. The separator is a middle dot.",
