    "vision.offer.continue": {
      "comment": "Button on Vision Pro, shown with the board's controls when another of the player's devices (an iPhone, a Mac) has moved a newer board. It opens that board instead of the one in front of them; the current board is kept, not deleted. \"Your other board\" is deliberately vague — the app does not know which device it came from. Short; a button label, not a sentence with a period.",
